1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
AI systems can say work is complete
before the evidence is retained.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
I built the Daily AI Agent Toolkit
to make that boundary explicit.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:18,000
It provides two local MCP servers, eight tools,
and six portable Agent Skills.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Evidence Gate checks a file beneath
an operator-supplied root.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:32,000
This synthetic report exists, but it is empty
and fails the required-text rule.

6
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,000
The result is FAIL,
with machine-readable findings.

7
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:46,000
This is a bounded local receipt,
not a semantic judgment.

8
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Release Gate converts the failed finding
into an explicit blocker.

9
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:58,000
The requirement, state, reason,
and repair remain visible.

10
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Invalid evidence does not become
an optimistic pass.

11
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:10,000
The next action remains inspectable.

12
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:17,000
I add the qualifying evidence
and rerun the identical check.

13
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:24,000
It now passes and records a byte count
and SHA-256 digest.

14
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:31,000
That proves this file met
this declared rule.

15
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:38,000
It does not prove every statement
in the report.

16
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Release Gate hashes the repaired artifact
into a retained release receipt.

17
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:50,000
The check status, path, byte count,
digest, and limitation travel together.

18
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:56,000
The receipt does not publish,
deploy, or approve anything.

19
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:02,000
It gives a reviewer reproducible evidence
for the next controlled decision.

20
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:08,000
A single demonstration
can be hand-picked.

21
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:14,000
The repository includes 20 declared outcomes
across all eight tools.

22
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:20,000
They cover PASS, FAIL, BLOCKED,
and UNVERIFIED states.

23
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:26,000
The catalog runs with 33 Python tests
and six deterministic skill self-tests.

24
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:33,000
The Daily AI Agent Toolkit
is open source, local, and deterministic.

25
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:40,000
It makes evidence, blockers, uncertainty,
and artifact identity easier to inspect.

26
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:47,000
That inspection happens before release.

27
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:54,000
A local pass is never semantic truth
or production proof.

28
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:59,000
And it is never publication authority.
